#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:1
#: a465af4531614fd3967ffc78c1047981
msgid "DFT-D3 修正"
msgstr "DFT-D3 Correction"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:3
#: 46dd90bd47864a97b32a81a839088071
msgid "界面按钮：`DFT D3`。"
msgstr "Toolbar action: `DFT D3`."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:5
#: 45c8873b6d5c461d8fe8f0842cbb7a0e
msgid "作用与适用场景"
msgstr "Purpose and use cases"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:7
#: 9fceea134f94465f81c59be92c85e1f0
msgid ""
"计算 DFT-D3 色散修正，并按所选模式加到或从当前能量、力和 virial 中扣除。 适合统一训练数据是否包含 D3 "
"的标签约定，不是用于随意改善散点图。"
msgstr "Calculate the DFT-D3 dispersion correction and either add it to or subtract it from the current energies, forces, and virials. Use this to make the training data follow one consistent convention on whether D3 is included—not to cosmetically improve a scatter plot."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:11
#: 9c604589d0c74a1c89d3bcdc29aebe6b
msgid "DFT-D3 计算仅支持 CPU。即使 NEP 后端选择了 GPU，执行这项操作时也会改用 CPU。"
msgstr "DFT-D3 calculation is CPU-only. This operation uses the CPU even when the NEP backend is set to GPU."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:14
#: ac603ddb154148cc97bc573243fa08e7
msgid "修正原理"
msgstr "Correction Principle"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:16
#: f3573f73a5a14429bbe040379b3d8b31
msgid ""
"DFT-D3 用元素、原子间距和配位环境计算经验色散能 $E_{\\mathrm{D3}}$，并由其对坐标和 应变的导数得到力 $\\mathbf"
" F_{\\mathrm{D3}}$ 与 virial $\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}}$。本工具不重新做 "
"DFT，只对已有标签执行一致的加减："
msgstr "DFT-D3 evaluates the empirical dispersion energy $E_{\\mathrm{D3}}$ from the elements, interatomic distances, and coordination environments. Its coordinate and strain derivatives give the forces $\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{D3}}$ and virial $\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}}$. This tool does not rerun DFT; it applies a consistent addition or subtraction to the existing labels:"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:20
#: 02b29beeae604139bae1bacd2ba9c6c6
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E' &= E+sE_{\\mathrm{D3}},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf F'_i &= \\mathbf F_i+s\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{D3},i},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf W' &= \\mathbf W+s\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"s=\\begin{cases}+1,&\\text{加上}\\\\-1,&\\text{减去。}\\end{cases}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"E' &= E+sE_{\\mathrm{D3}},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf F'_i &= \\mathbf F_i+s\\mathbf F_{\\mathrm{D3},i},\\\\\n"
"\\mathbf W' &= \\mathbf W+s\\mathbf W_{\\mathrm{D3}},\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"s=\\begin{cases}+1,&\\text{add}\\\\-1,&\\text{subtract}.\\end{cases}\n"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:30
#: 2c028ef9b18b4acdb72a57bee7f84fce
msgid ""
"`交换-相关泛函`决定 D3 阻尼参数，必须与原始 DFT 泛函一致；`D3 截断半径`控制色散原子对， "
"`配位数截断半径`控制配位环境计算，两者单位均为 Å。截断半径不是“精度越大越好”的普通滑块： "
"增大会提高计算量，也可能改变与原始标签约定的一致性。"
msgstr "The `Exchange-correlation functional` selects the D3 damping parameters and must match the functional used for the original DFT calculation. `D3 cutoff radius` limits dispersion pairs, while `Coordination-number cutoff radius` limits coordination-environment evaluation; both are in Å. These cutoffs are not ordinary accuracy sliders: increasing them costs more and can also change consistency with the original labeling convention."

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:34
#: b4e479039e8a4a6c94917afa41551dcf
msgid "参数与执行结果"
msgstr "Parameters and execution result"

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8385
#: 267c7f02fc0f40349b3498a8d70d3180
msgid "输入控件：`交换-相关泛函`、`D3 截断半径`、`配位数截断半径`和`修正方式（加上/减去）`。"
msgstr "Controls: `Exchange-correlation functional`, `D3 cutoff radius`, `Coordination-number cutoff radius`, and the correction mode (`Add` or `Subtract`)."

#: ../../source/module/nep-dataset-display-content.md:8386
#: ecfe4b8661cf4cc3aa5151918da64a4d
msgid "执行结果：后台应用 DFT-D3 修正并重绘。"
msgstr "Result: apply the DFT-D3 correction in the background and redraw the plots."

