#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:41
#: f9be5978a94f42358a742335b9d70a0d
msgid "操作后检查"
msgstr "Post-operation checks"

#: ../../source/module/nep-main-tool-dft-d3.md:43
#: 888bb0311e3746c1bce9467a7c598a0d
msgid ""
"`functional` 必须与原始 DFT 计算采用的泛函一致。完成后比较修正前后的能量和力分布， 并确认 `Add/Subtract` "
"与目标标签约定一致；方向选反会造成整批数据系统性偏移。"
msgstr "`functional` must match the functional used in the original DFT calculation. After the operation, compare the energy and force distributions before and after correction, and confirm that `Add/Subtract` matches the intended label convention. Choosing the wrong direction shifts the entire dataset systematically."
